OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after four pedestrians hurt
OL,4,Ain hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after four
OL,7,Fpedestrians were injured in a
OL,8,Fhit-and-run while they were crossing a
OL,9,Froad in Leicester city centre.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said it happened
OL,12,Fin Vaughan Way, at a crossing towards
OL,13,Fthe junction with Highcross Street, at
OL,14,F22:12 BST on Saturday, and involved a
OL,15,Fsilver vehicle which failed to stop.
OL,17,FThree men were taken to hospital with
OL,18,Fserious injuries, the fourth man got up
OL,19,Fand walked away and was not taken to
OL,20,Fhospital, said officers.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
