OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after four pedestrians hurt
OL,4,Ain hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing inquiries, a 38-year-old man
OL,7,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,9,Fdriving, drink driving and causing
OL,10,Fgrievous bodily harm. He remains in
OL,11,Fpolice custody.
